title: "StatsmodelsMasterPro: research-grade statistical modeling, inference, and validation with statsmodels"
version: 2.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-27
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/SatvikPraveen/StatsmodelsMasterPro"
authors:
