keywords:
  - statistics
  - statsmodels
  - bootstrap
  - causal inference
  - Monte Carlo
  - reproducibility
abstract: >-
  A validated toolkit layered on statsmodels providing resampling and robust
  inference, effect sizes, causal inference estimators, mediation and moderation,
  an ADEMP-style Monte Carlo framework with Monte Carlo standard errors, model
  selection, time-series evaluation, survival helpers, and publication-ready
  reporting, together with seventeen seeded synthetic datasets whose true
  parameters are recorded and continuously checked by a parameter-recovery study.
